<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia central bank sets new intervention band.</title>
<headline>Indonesia central bank sets new intervention band.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's central bank, Bank Indonesia, set its new intervention band at 2,309/2,501 rupiah against the dollar on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The central bank earlier said it was widening its intervention band to eight percent from five percent effective immediately.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
